WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.900
Ever wonder what a roofer
actually does up there?

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:07.800
Right. Here's the whole visit.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.900
Joe comes out himself
and walks the roof.

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:15.800
Shingles, flashing, vents, gutters.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:19.900
He takes photos
so you see what he sees.

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:23.800
Fix it, watch it,
or leave it alone.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:27.900
It's free. No pressure.
Joe answers his own phone.

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:32.000
Book at nobigdealwithjoedeal.com/inspect
